; LAIR APPROACH — a transitional cell (2026-09 world rebuild). Generated by tools/new_cell_scenes.py.
;
; Ground, elevation, collision, vegetation and any road across it are authored in data/regions/*.tres (via
; tools/region_spec_*.py) and prepared by the world bake. This cell WAS empty; the campaign gave it exactly one beat on
; purpose, the herd trail of the Ashen arc (see the CAMPAIGN comment at the foot of the file).
