; CAMPAIGN (WR-spec1-12, 31, 32, 40, 66, 67): THE HERD TRAIL. The empty approach cell now holds the new pin
; location.ashen.herd_trail (anchor: HerdTrail), the third staked track, the herd of fork F3 in three states (standing,
; lying down once calmed, the cull once slain) and the two set pieces that follow the choice.
; The ground here is a shallow of ash on a steady 6 degree slope. Only direct children of the cell root are conformed to the
; terrain, so each state of the herd is four small Entities (one per quadrant of its 6 m disc), each tilted onto the fitted ground
; plane (a gentle, even slope is the reason this spot was picked: 8 m radius, 0.10 m worst residual) and each conformed to the
; ground under its own origin.

